# A scratch checkout with its own .git, committed by accident as a submodule
# pointer with no .gitmodules entry — which made every CI checkout fail with
# "No url found for submodule path" and exit 128. Its contents were never in
# this repository, only a dangling pointer to a commit nobody has.
temp-repo/
